182|/// (C3 extension, wave 2c) The `http` engine's OpenRouter route: the class `openrouter` for the
183|/// host `openrouter.ai` (and its subdomains). OpenRouter resells other labs' models under
184|/// `<vendor>/<model>` ids, so its model token is that form - sent only when the vendor part is an
185|/// OpenRouter vendor slug of [`OPENROUTER_VENDORS`] AND the model part EQUALS an entry of that
186|/// class's closed list (after lower-casing, `[1m]` stripped), else `other`
187|/// ([`openrouter_model_token`]). Not a row of the plugin's table: the plugin has no http engine.
188|pub(crate) static OPENROUTER: Vendor = Vendor {
189|    class: "openrouter",
190|    hosts: &["openrouter.ai"],
191|    engine: "",
192|    builtin: "",
193|    models: &[],
194|};
