1|//! (C3 wave 8 = the plugin's wave 30, TECH_DEBT T15) Quota windows: what Codex itself reports.
2|//!
3|//! Codex CLI (0.155) writes a `token_count` event into a thread's rollout,
4|//! `<codex home>/sessions/<yyyy>/<mm>/<dd>/rollout-<timestamp>-<thread id>.jsonl`, after every model
5|//! request:
6|//!
7|//! ```text
8|//! {"timestamp":"...","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"token_count","info":{"total_token_usage":
9|//!  {"input_tokens":..,"cached_input_tokens":..,"output_tokens":..},"last_token_usage":{...},
10|//!  "model_context_window":258400},"rate_limits":{"limit_id":"codex","primary":{"used_percent":96.0,
11|//!  "window_minutes":300,"resets_at":<unix s>},"secondary":{...},...}}}
12|//! ```
13|//!
14|//! `primary` = the 5-hour window, `secondary` = the weekly one of a ChatGPT subscription (null on
15|//! other plans and in older rollouts). Every request writes TWO such lines: the `codex` one, then one
16|//! with `"limit_id":"premium"`, null windows and the same totals - the reader takes the LAST line that
17|//! names a window, and counts a call only where the total changed. The totals are CUMULATIVE over the
18|//! thread's life and a fork INHERITS its parent's: the tokens of ONE run are its last total minus the
19|//! last total before it started (the parent's rollout for a fork, the same rollout for a resume).
20|//! Sub-agent threads (Codex feature `multi_agent`) are rollouts of their own whose first line
21|//! (`session_meta`) names `"parent_thread_id":"<parent>"`; their totals start at zero.
22|//!
23|//! A window at or above [`QUOTA_BLOCK_PERCENT`] whose reset lies ahead keeps the endpoint out until
24|//! that reset (`crate::health::endpoint_health_set`, like a usage limit with a known reset); at or
25|//! above [`QUOTA_WARN_PERCENT`] the available verdict says `low quota: ...`. A reset in the past
26|//! means the window was reset: shown, never judged.
27|//!
28|//! Ported from the plugin's `codex-consult-common.ps1` (wave 30): `Get-RolloutTokenEvents`,
29|//! `Get-RolloutUsage`, `Get-CodexRolloutPath`, `Get-CodexSubagentRollouts`, `Get-CodexRunQuota`,
30|//! `Select-NewerWindow`, `Get-QuotaWindowName`, `Format-QuotaPercent`, `Format-QuotaReset`,
31|//! `Get-QuotaWindowStates`, `Format-QuotaWindows`, `Get-CodexAccountWindow`, `Get-EndpointWindow`,
32|//! `Format-QuotaLowWarning`, `Read-RolloutPrimaryWindow`, `Get-ForkReplayGuard`,
